(7434563, 1173687, 16148, '<td valign="top">Amazing scene and well caught.  Very nice!</td>', 'Amazing scene and well caught.  Very nice!', '2016-02-03 23:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434564, 1175094, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice street shot with a terrific shadow.</td>', 'Nice street shot with a terrific shadow.', '2016-02-03 23:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434565, 1174892, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture and your exposure creates an illusion of flatness in a good way.  Not sure I like the toning for this particular image but it doesn''t detract.  Very nice!</td>', 'Interesting texture and your exposure creates an illusion of flatness in a good way.  Not sure I like the toning for this particular image but it doesn''t detract.  Very nice!', '2016-02-03 23:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434566, 1174935, 16148, '<td valign="top">I enjoy as found gifts that we just need to see.  Nice find!</td>', 'I enjoy as found gifts that we just need to see.  Nice find!', '2016-02-03 23:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434567, 1174983, 16148, '<td valign="top">My favorite photograph in the challenge.  Thank you.</td>', 'My favorite photograph in the challenge.  Thank you.', '2016-02-03 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434568, 1175214, 16148, '<td valign="top">Painterly without the cheesy faux brushstrokes.  Wonderful catch!</td>', 'Painterly without the cheesy faux brushstrokes.  Wonderful catch!', '2016-02-03 23:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434638, 1174954, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a wonderful moment.  You got great detail and good timing in the shot.  Wish it was a bit tighter crop and not so centered tho.</td>', 'Great capture of a wonderful moment.  You got great detail and good timing in the shot.  Wish it was a bit tighter crop and not so centered tho.', '2016-02-04 13:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434639, 1174699, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and wonderful B&amp;W conversation.  Not sure how else you could have photographed this wonderful bridge but the photo kind of leads you eye out of the frame on the right verse keeping you looking at the bridge.</td>', 'Beautiful and wonderful B&W conversation.  Not sure how else you could have photographed this wonderful bridge but the photo kind of leads you eye out of the frame on the right verse keeping you looking at the bridge.', '2016-02-04 13:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434640, 1175114, 47974, '<td valign="top">Love the conversion and great leading lines.......the pier leads the eye right to the building at the end.  I am not sure how I feel about the bird, in some ways I like it but in others I find it a bit distracting.  I guess it is one of those things where some will like it and others will not.</td>', 'Love the conversion and great leading lines.......the pier leads the eye right to the building at the end.  I am not sure how I feel about the bird, in some ways I like it but in others I find it a bit distracting.  I guess it is one of those things where some will like it and others will not.', '2016-02-04 13:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434641, 1175178, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract and gives the impression of a wonderful painting.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract and gives the impression of a wonderful painting.', '2016-02-04 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434642, 1173829, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really great capture but I just want to stare at the plane and not the beautiful sky.</td>', 'Really great capture but I just want to stare at the plane and not the beautiful sky.', '2016-02-04 13:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434643, 1174903, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a beautiful bird (I like the female cardinals more then the males) and really conveys the cold and rain the bird is experiencing.</td>', 'Great capture of a beautiful bird (I like the female cardinals more then the males) and really conveys the cold and rain the bird is experiencing.', '2016-02-04 13:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434690, 1175073, 47974, '<td valign="top">That''s an old looking deer stand.</td>', 'That''s an old looking deer stand.', '2016-02-04 19:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434691, 1174669, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really like the subject and the frozen branches.  This appears to me like it is a very large crop or some funny sharpening going on.</td>', 'Really like the subject and the frozen branches.  This appears to me like it is a very large crop or some funny sharpening going on.', '2016-02-04 19:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434692, 1172983, 47974, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the bird is a little soft, otherwise a great capture.</td>', 'Unfortunately the bird is a little soft, otherwise a great capture.', '2016-02-04 19:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434696, 1175089, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really like the old time feel of the processing and a great perspective.</td>', 'Really like the old time feel of the processing and a great perspective.', '2016-02-04 19:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434699, 1174788, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wildlife photos look better when you get down (or up) to the perspective of the animal.  Personally I am not a fan of the perspective of a person looking down on a bird.</td>', 'Wildlife photos look better when you get down (or up) to the perspective of the animal.  Personally I am not a fan of the perspective of a person looking down on a bird.', '2016-02-04 19:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434702, 1174517, 47974, '<td valign="top">For this style of photograph I really prefer an even background, I find the fade from true white to that off gray color distracting.  Good job of shooting white on white and keeping enough detail in the blacks tho.</td>', 'For this style of photograph I really prefer an even background, I find the fade from true white to that off gray color distracting.  Good job of shooting white on white and keeping enough detail in the blacks tho.', '2016-02-04 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434708, 1174855, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture and perspective.  Just wish you had cloned out the power lines.</td>', 'Great capture and perspective.  Just wish you had cloned out the power lines.', '2016-02-04 20:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434710, 1174634, 47974, '<td valign="top">Better title would have been Bell Lap, but then everyone may not know what that means.</td>', 'Better title would have been Bell Lap, but then everyone may not know what that means.', '2016-02-04 20:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434711, 1174492, 47974, '<td valign="top">You captured the cold the bird feels very well.</td>', 'You captured the cold the bird feels very well.', '2016-02-04 20:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434712, 1175202, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a beautiful cat.</td>', 'Great capture of a beautiful cat.', '2016-02-04 20:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434713, 1174691, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful conversion. Would shooting from the other side not have building in the background?  It would have made a much stronger photograph without the buildings.</td>', 'Wonderful conversion. Would shooting from the other side not have building in the background?  It would have made a much stronger photograph without the buildings.', '2016-02-04 20:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434714, 1175147, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting catch that Great Blue Heron (I assume that is what it is) has.  One place I do a lot of bird photography is full of big bull frogs but I have yet to see a bird catch one (100''s of hours watching too) so great catch by both of you.  The photo looks like it is pretty large crop and/or over aggressive sharpening, which is to bad.</td>', 'Interesting catch that Great Blue Heron (I assume that is what it is) has.  One place I do a lot of bird photography is full of big bull frogs but I have yet to see a bird catch one (100''s of hours watching too) so great catch by both of you.  The photo looks like it is pretty large crop and/or over aggressive sharpening, which is to bad.', '2016-02-04 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434740, 1172961, 38032, '<td valign="top">VT?</td>', 'VT?', '2016-02-04 23:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434742, 1175055, 38032, '<td valign="top">a nice find for sure.</td>', 'a nice find for sure.', '2016-02-04 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434744, 1174492, 38032, '<td valign="top">love the raw beauty here</td>', 'love the raw beauty here', '2016-02-04 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434749, 1174935, 38032, '<td valign="top">a delight. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1174300" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174300.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174300.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174300.png"/></a></td>', 'a delight. ', '2016-02-04 23:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434753, 1175107, 38032, '<td valign="top">woah.<br/>if this is real, it is breaking rad: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1174300" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174300.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174300.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1174300.png"/></a></td>', 'woah.if this is real, it is breaking rad: ', '2016-02-04 23:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434838, 1175055, 114285, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image</td>', 'Fascinating image', '2016-02-05 01:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434839, 1174699, 114285, '<td valign="top">Love how  the sky seems to be dancing with the bridge.</td>', 'Love how  the sky seems to be dancing with the bridge.', '2016-02-05 01:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434841, 1175205, 114285, '<td valign="top">Ha, love it!!!</td>', 'Ha, love it!!!', '2016-02-05 01:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434847, 1175063, 24486, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I am looking at but you did make me google scrying.</td>', 'I have no idea what I am looking at but you did make me google scrying.', '2016-02-05 02:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434848, 1175219, 24486, '<td valign="top">I know how difficult it is to capture this type of shot even if you know where the bird is going to land. Beautifully timed.</td>', 'I know how difficult it is to capture this type of shot even if you know where the bird is going to land. Beautifully timed.', '2016-02-05 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434943, 1173291, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and perfect composition.</td>', 'Wonderful capture and perfect composition.', '2016-02-05 13:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434944, 1175190, 47974, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture of a beautiful location.</td>', 'Perfect capture of a beautiful location.', '2016-02-05 13:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434945, 1174790, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture of wonderful moment to witness.  Just wish the background was a forest and not a city.</td>', 'Great capture of wonderful moment to witness.  Just wish the background was a forest and not a city.', '2016-02-05 13:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434955, 1174490, 47974, '<td valign="top">You have really captured the feeling of being out there.</td>', 'You have really captured the feeling of being out there.', '2016-02-05 14:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434956, 1175113, 47974, '<td valign="top">Very odd angle that makes me want to turn my head to look at the photo.</td>', 'Very odd angle that makes me want to turn my head to look at the photo.', '2016-02-05 14:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434957, 1174818, 47974, '<td valign="top">The title really fits the photograph.</td>', 'The title really fits the photograph.', '2016-02-05 14:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434960, 1175163, 47974, '<td valign="top">I really like the conversion and abstract nature of the photograph.  Would have been a stronger shot if you had cropped out the top part.</td>', 'I really like the conversion and abstract nature of the photograph.  Would have been a stronger shot if you had cropped out the top part.', '2016-02-05 14:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434961, 1174999, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and detail with just the right amount of DoF.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and detail with just the right amount of DoF.', '2016-02-05 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434964, 1175047, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture that really draws me in......the processing is just a little over the top for my taste.  Not sure what it is that bothers me about the processing, wish I could figure out exactly what it is.</td>', 'Interesting capture that really draws me in......the processing is just a little over the top for my taste.  Not sure what it is that bothers me about the processing, wish I could figure out exactly what it is.', '2016-02-05 14:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434967, 1175205, 47974, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird and such an amazing thing to watch.  Really would have preferred a bit different crop so there was more room in front of the eagle.  The photograph is also a little soft, which is unfortunate.</td>', 'Beautiful bird and such an amazing thing to watch.  Really would have preferred a bit different crop so there was more room in front of the eagle.  The photograph is also a little soft, which is unfortunate.', '2016-02-05 14:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434968, 1174789, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really great capture of an amazing bird, to bad you did not have a better sky for the backdrop (can''t count the number of times I have wished that on photos I have taken).  Would prefer a bit tighter crop that was not also so centered tho.</td>', 'Really great capture of an amazing bird, to bad you did not have a better sky for the backdrop (can''t count the number of times I have wished that on photos I have taken).  Would prefer a bit tighter crop that was not also so centered tho.', '2016-02-05 14:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7434986, 1175155, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great capture and perfect timing (have to love how useful high speed shooting is in the new cameras).  Photograph has great detail and the composition is spot on.  Just wish the guy on the horse in the background was not there, he is a bit distracting but I understand you don''t have control of things like this.</td>', 'Great capture and perfect timing (have to love how useful high speed shooting is in the new cameras).  Photograph has great detail and the composition is spot on.  Just wish the guy on the horse in the background was not there, he is a bit distracting but I understand you don''t have control of things like this.', '2016-02-05 16:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435033, 1174960, 126939, '<td valign="top">0</td>', '0', '2016-02-05 20:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435034, 1175134, 126939, '<td valign="top">p</td>', 'p', '2016-02-05 20:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435047, 1174868, 24486, '<td valign="top">Well done. Very nicely timed</td>', 'Well done. Very nicely timed', '2016-02-05 23:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435064, 1174925, 40391, '<td valign="top">Thinly veiled evil.</td>', 'Thinly veiled evil.', '2016-02-06 05:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435065, 1174729, 40391, '<td valign="top">It took me a second to understand what I was looking at and then I was pleasantly surprised.</td>', 'It took me a second to understand what I was looking at and then I was pleasantly surprised.', '2016-02-06 05:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435066, 1175113, 40391, '<td valign="top">Is that a ''light globe''? ;)</td>', 'Is that a ''light globe''? ;)', '2016-02-06 05:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435067, 1174489, 40391, '<td valign="top">The wedding ring. This is a different take on the technique which is appreciated. I have yet to try this myself.</td>', 'The wedding ring. This is a different take on the technique which is appreciated. I have yet to try this myself.', '2016-02-06 05:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435068, 1174983, 40391, '<td valign="top">The softness and tones adds well to this image. I like the retro feel (as well as the matching socks and rug).</td>', 'The softness and tones adds well to this image. I like the retro feel (as well as the matching socks and rug).', '2016-02-06 05:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435069, 1174850, 40391, '<td valign="top">A painting of this would be wonderful but I feel I''m missing out on a lovely photo. I do love the white, green, and lacking other colours.</td>', 'A painting of this would be wonderful but I feel I''m missing out on a lovely photo. I do love the white, green, and lacking other colours.', '2016-02-06 05:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435070, 1175019, 40391, '<td valign="top">Pat-a-cake, pat-a-cake, baker''s man.</td>', 'Pat-a-cake, pat-a-cake, baker''s man.', '2016-02-06 05:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435071, 1175119, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great location. Seeing these lights is very high on my bucket-list.</td>', 'Great location. Seeing these lights is very high on my bucket-list.', '2016-02-06 05:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435072, 1174637, 40391, '<td valign="top">Minimal elements but each is really interesting. The coke sign looks painted on the wall. The girl in pink is focused on the emptiness of the path. The girl walking away has a red pompom. And of course, the gull finishes it off nicely.</td>', 'Minimal elements but each is really interesting. The coke sign looks painted on the wall. The girl in pink is focused on the emptiness of the path. The girl walking away has a red pompom. And of course, the gull finishes it off nicely.', '2016-02-06 05:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435073, 1174999, 40391, '<td valign="top">Moth, such big eyes you have!<br/> <br/>I haven''t seen many macro bug shots lately. I''m glad my first is a good one.</td>', 'Moth, such big eyes you have! I haven''t seen many macro bug shots lately. I''m glad my first is a good one.', '2016-02-06 05:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435074, 1175143, 40391, '<td valign="top">white and brown, on white and brown (except for the black nose, hehe). I love the eyes and raised ears.</td>', 'white and brown, on white and brown (except for the black nose, hehe). I love the eyes and raised ears.', '2016-02-06 05:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435075, 1175135, 40391, '<td valign="top">I can feel the tension. Wonderful colours.</td>', 'I can feel the tension. Wonderful colours.', '2016-02-06 05:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435076, 1175089, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the border, but I''m very much a fan of the shot, processing and title.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the border, but I''m very much a fan of the shot, processing and title.', '2016-02-06 05:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435077, 1175068, 40391, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the milky smoothness you captured.</td>', 'I particularly like the milky smoothness you captured.', '2016-02-06 05:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435078, 1175137, 40391, '<td valign="top">The root of all evil.</td>', 'The root of all evil.', '2016-02-06 05:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435079, 1175046, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice inclusion of that bird. Looks bloody cold.</td>', 'Nice inclusion of that bird. Looks bloody cold.', '2016-02-06 05:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435080, 1175073, 40391, '<td valign="top">I can really feel the cold in this image despite the warm tones. I guess there''s not much use for the bird hide this time of year?</td>', 'I can really feel the cold in this image despite the warm tones. I guess there''s not much use for the bird hide this time of year?', '2016-02-06 05:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435081, 1174954, 40391, '<td valign="top">I wonder what song they''re singing? Nice capture.</td>', 'I wonder what song they''re singing? Nice capture.', '2016-02-06 05:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435082, 1175047, 40391, '<td valign="top">Standing room only. The strong processing works well here though the green could have been toned down a little for my taste.</td>', 'Standing room only. The strong processing works well here though the green could have been toned down a little for my taste.', '2016-02-06 05:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435083, 1175217, 40391, '<td valign="top">I do love these images and this is a great example. I''m glad you took it with people though I wish they were a bit closer to you. Black &amp; white is a good choice and you did it very well.</td>', 'I do love these images and this is a great example. I''m glad you took it with people though I wish they were a bit closer to you. Black & white is a good choice and you did it very well.', '2016-02-06 05:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435084, 1175090, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m not much of a fan of the painting processing I''m seeing more often now. However, this is one of the best examples I''ve seen yet. A really beautiful still life.</td>', 'I''m not much of a fan of the painting processing I''m seeing more often now. However, this is one of the best examples I''ve seen yet. A really beautiful still life.', '2016-02-06 05:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435085, 1174981, 40391, '<td valign="top">I like the combined warm and cool tones you have achieved.</td>', 'I like the combined warm and cool tones you have achieved.', '2016-02-06 05:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435086, 1175190, 40391, '<td valign="top">It has a collage feeling and I''m not quite sure how you got so many stars without trails or the ability to track. However, the tent is the winning element in this shot.</td>', 'It has a collage feeling and I''m not quite sure how you got so many stars without trails or the ability to track. However, the tent is the winning element in this shot.', '2016-02-06 05:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435087, 1174786, 40391, '<td valign="top">It looks lonely by itself. It is definitely gold in colour.</td>', 'It looks lonely by itself. It is definitely gold in colour.', '2016-02-06 05:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435088, 1173986, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I like how it has applied a nice layer of camo makeup.</td>', 'Great capture. I like how it has applied a nice layer of camo makeup.', '2016-02-06 05:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435089, 1175166, 40391, '<td valign="top">That is one mad car. Nice capture, including that flag.</td>', 'That is one mad car. Nice capture, including that flag.', '2016-02-06 05:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435090, 1175110, 40391, '<td valign="top">I could not get relaxed enough to sleep under a trailer. I''ve seen too many Final Destination movies.</td>', 'I could not get relaxed enough to sleep under a trailer. I''ve seen too many Final Destination movies.', '2016-02-06 06:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435091, 1175147, 40391, '<td valign="top">Or maybe she''s just taking a prince home for her daughter. Nice capture.</td>', 'Or maybe she''s just taking a prince home for her daughter. Nice capture.', '2016-02-06 06:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435092, 1174670, 40391, '<td valign="top">It''s like they''re cuddling to keep warm, or perhaps for comfort from the approaching stranger. I do like the low key feeling of this image.</td>', 'It''s like they''re cuddling to keep warm, or perhaps for comfort from the approaching stranger. I do like the low key feeling of this image.', '2016-02-06 06:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435093, 1174960, 40391, '<td valign="top">You really made the eyes pop. Looks like it''s having a ball, without a ball (they''re for dogs).</td>', 'You really made the eyes pop. Looks like it''s having a ball, without a ball (they''re for dogs).', '2016-02-06 06:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435094, 1174975, 40391, '<td valign="top">i-iphone.<br/> <br/>Great reflection.</td>', 'i-iphone. Great reflection.', '2016-02-06 06:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435095, 1175138, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great colour, especially in the reflection.</td>', 'Great colour, especially in the reflection.', '2016-02-06 06:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435096, 1175114, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and composition. I love that bird too.</td>', 'Wonderful tones and composition. I love that bird too.', '2016-02-06 06:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435097, 1174699, 40391, '<td valign="top">Powerful. Though I feel the bridge is on the verge of toppling over. I really like that sky.</td>', 'Powerful. Though I feel the bridge is on the verge of toppling over. I really like that sky.', '2016-02-06 06:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435098, 1173798, 40391, '<td valign="top">A nice contrasting shot.</td>', 'A nice contrasting shot.', '2016-02-06 06:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435099, 1174788, 40391, '<td valign="top">It would appear they''re both feeling a little down ;)</td>', 'It would appear they''re both feeling a little down ;)', '2016-02-06 06:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435100, 1175055, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Great find. Fascinating.</td>', 'Wonderful image. Great find. Fascinating.', '2016-02-06 06:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435101, 1174932, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, beautiful colour.</td>', 'Wonderful image, beautiful colour.', '2016-02-06 06:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435102, 1174790, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lucky fish, it''s nice to have a couple of birds fight over you.<br/> <br/>And after that inappropriate comment, great capture!</td>', 'Lucky fish, it''s nice to have a couple of birds fight over you. And after that inappropriate comment, great capture!', '2016-02-06 06:22:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7435103, 1175182, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m taking your word for it as it has a more northerly feeling for me. Then again, there probably are clouds to the west, I just can''t see them.</td>', 'I''m taking your word for it as it has a more northerly feeling for me. Then again, there probably are clouds to the west, I just can''t see them.', '2016-02-06 06:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435104, 1175168, 40391, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see it at first but I love that face. Art at the timber yard.</td>', 'I didn''t see it at first but I love that face. Art at the timber yard.', '2016-02-06 06:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435105, 1174691, 40391, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the story is here? Missing parts, bullet holes, and long grass.</td>', 'I wonder what the story is here? Missing parts, bullet holes, and long grass.', '2016-02-06 06:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435106, 1174881, 40391, '<td valign="top">I guess these ducks are too lazy to fly south for the winter. I love that mist and colour.</td>', 'I guess these ducks are too lazy to fly south for the winter. I love that mist and colour.', '2016-02-06 06:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435120, 1173687, 179769, '<td valign="top">Post processing kept this from being an 8 or 9 for me.   It''s not quite sharp enough and colors should pop.</td>', 'Post processing kept this from being an 8 or 9 for me.   It''s not quite sharp enough and colors should pop.', '2016-02-06 10:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435122, 1174287, 179769, '<td valign="top">Too much "blue" for me.  Otherwise, a lovely shot.</td>', 'Too much "blue" for me.  Otherwise, a lovely shot.', '2016-02-06 10:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435123, 1174669, 179769, '<td valign="top">A bit over sharpened, but otherwise, really nice!</td>', 'A bit over sharpened, but otherwise, really nice!', '2016-02-06 11:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435139, 1175134, 24486, '<td valign="top">Well worth being in the cold to capture this. Good luck</td>', 'Well worth being in the cold to capture this. Good luck', '2016-02-06 12:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435140, 1174974, 100831, '<td valign="top">Incredible... I can feel it blowing. Lovely composition and color. 9</td>', 'Incredible... I can feel it blowing. Lovely composition and color. 9', '2016-02-06 12:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435142, 1175214, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the painterly effect... all in all a wonderful image.</td>', 'I like the painterly effect... all in all a wonderful image.', '2016-02-06 12:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435144, 1175119, 24486, '<td valign="top">Photographs like this just encourage me to come to Iceland. This one is going to be another one that is hard to beat</td>', 'Photographs like this just encourage me to come to Iceland. This one is going to be another one that is hard to beat', '2016-02-06 12:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435178, 1174224, 40391, '<td valign="top">Minimal, simple and beautiful.</td>', 'Minimal, simple and beautiful.', '2016-02-06 19:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435179, 1175211, 40391, '<td valign="top">And the sun glare finishes this nicely.</td>', 'And the sun glare finishes this nicely.', '2016-02-06 19:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435180, 1172961, 40391, '<td valign="top">Dark, moody and pretty. Great find and nicely processed.</td>', 'Dark, moody and pretty. Great find and nicely processed.', '2016-02-06 19:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435181, 1175112, 40391, '<td valign="top">And the fish said "So, how is that supposed to help me?".<br/> <br/>For such a serious piece of architecture that ''Exit'' sign is so comical. It is a cool reflection.</td>', 'And the fish said "So, how is that supposed to help me?". For such a serious piece of architecture that ''Exit'' sign is so comical. It is a cool reflection.', '2016-02-06 20:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435184, 1174905, 40391, '<td valign="top">An amazing place. I like the way you centered her.</td>', 'An amazing place. I like the way you centered her.', '2016-02-06 20:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435185, 1175094, 40391, '<td valign="top">Fun with shadows. Nice capture.</td>', 'Fun with shadows. Nice capture.', '2016-02-06 20:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435186, 1174924, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and good lighting. The blown highlight on the wall does draw my eye but needs me to visit Tom on the way so it kind of works.</td>', 'Nice portrait and good lighting. The blown highlight on the wall does draw my eye but needs me to visit Tom on the way so it kind of works.', '2016-02-06 20:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435188, 1175201, 40391, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Not sure if I would trust the Allstate Appliance Center for delivering my white-goods seeing how they secure an upside-down appliance.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Not sure if I would trust the Allstate Appliance Center for delivering my white-goods seeing how they secure an upside-down appliance.', '2016-02-06 20:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435189, 1175102, 40391, '<td valign="top">I love birds, especially lots of birds. The biggest problem I have is that holding a camera with a large lens usually sends the birds away from me so I get mostly bird-butts too.</td>', 'I love birds, especially lots of birds. The biggest problem I have is that holding a camera with a large lens usually sends the birds away from me so I get mostly bird-butts too.', '2016-02-06 21:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435190, 1175205, 40391, '<td valign="top">There are Sea Eagles around where I live and yet I''ve yet to see one catch a fish, let alone photo it. Nice capture.</td>', 'There are Sea Eagles around where I live and yet I''ve yet to see one catch a fish, let alone photo it. Nice capture.', '2016-02-06 21:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435191, 1174914, 40391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrasts, layers and lighting. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful contrasts, layers and lighting. Well done.', '2016-02-06 21:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435192, 1174085, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great joy and the right amount of softness.</td>', 'Great joy and the right amount of softness.', '2016-02-06 21:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435193, 1174917, 40391, '<td valign="top">Reflections captured well create wonder collages with some hidden gems like this one. I love the seagull.</td>', 'Reflections captured well create wonder collages with some hidden gems like this one. I love the seagull.', '2016-02-06 21:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435194, 1173895, 40391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location. You got those sheep attention.</td>', 'Beautiful location. You got those sheep attention.', '2016-02-06 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435195, 1175045, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. I love the high contrast, leading lines and composition. Her pose, dress and hair finishes this image perfectly.</td>', 'Wonderful image. I love the high contrast, leading lines and composition. Her pose, dress and hair finishes this image perfectly.', '2016-02-06 21:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7435196, 1175108, 40391, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely location. The bright red reflection (spectrum?) keeps drawing my attention away from the view. For some it could be annoying but it intrigues me and actually adds interest.</td>', 'Such a lovely location. The bright red reflection (spectrum?) keeps drawing my attention away from the view. For some it could be annoying but it intrigues me and actually adds interest.', '2016-02-06 21:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
