(7435524, 1174930, 34659, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful shot (scored a 9 from me).<br/> <br/><i>[Just kidding here]<br/>I sometimes think that everything from Iceland should be banned because it has the most amazingly gorgeous scenery.  The landscape there is hard &amp; soft &amp; wet &amp; frozen &amp; remote &amp; all-encompassing...  Plus I think everyone there is a professional photographer!<br/></i> <br/>Truly a paradise.  I can''t wait to visit one day!  Congrats on a great image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-02-08 07:09:50.</i></td>', 'Another beautiful shot (scored a 9 from me). [Just kidding here]I sometimes think that everything from Iceland should be banned because it has the most amazingly gorgeous scenery.  The landscape there is hard & soft & wet & frozen & remote & all-encompassing...  Plus I think everyone there is a professional photographer! Truly a paradise.  I can''t wait to visit one day!  Congrats on a great image.', '2016-02-08 00:10:04.000000', '2016-02-08 07:09:50.000000', 0),
