(7435738, 1175211, 38162, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> I have the same dilemma about how to shoot this. The tip of the wings touching the Freedom towerthey don''t seem to work together. The trees bring a nice touch here and in reality. I''ll mark 6 but think that we could do better </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>some day you and I will meet there and deal with the damn construction and figure out the right damn angle to shoot this.  this construction zone will last our entire lives ... but I digress.  your point is very well taken, this was all I could come up with.  oh, and "freedom tower" has not been used in at least a decade (WTC 1 is all that is needed) - that jingoism never really got off the ground locally, which (IMO) is a tribute to NYers if not the tourist brochures.<br/> <br/>thanks for your comment!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: I have the same dilemma about how to shoot this. The tip of the wings touching the Freedom towerthey don''t seem to work together. The trees bring a nice touch here and in reality. I''ll mark 6 but think that we could do better   some day you and I will meet there and deal with the damn construction and figure out the right damn angle to shoot this.  this construction zone will last our entire lives ... but I digress.  your point is very well taken, this was all I could come up with.  oh, and "freedom tower" has not been used in at least a decade (WTC 1 is all that is needed) - that jingoism never really got off the ground locally, which (IMO) is a tribute to NYers if not the tourist brochures. thanks for your comment! ', '2016-02-08 21:04:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7435750, 1174637, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a terrible advertisement for Coke. It doesn''t add life. It allows life to add itself.<br/> <br/>oh, but it is the pause that refreshes ... but a terrible advertisement because there is room in that pause... for anything, for dread, for a spirit of never needing soda, for the soul, for evolution, for anything.</td>', 'this is a terrible advertisement for Coke. It doesn''t add life. It allows life to add itself. oh, but it is the pause that refreshes ... but a terrible advertisement because there is room in that pause... for anything, for dread, for a spirit of never needing soda, for the soul, for evolution, for anything.', '2016-02-08 22:14:10.000000', NULL, 0),
